NIST SP 800-90B reference implementation, source code, in attest/qrng_attest/predictors.py:

  A translation into Python, made on 2026-10-03, of the four prediction estimators and the
  prediction estimate of NIST's reference implementation of SP 800-90B, version 1.1.8,
  https://github.com/usnistgov/SP800-90B_EntropyAssessment: cpp/non_iid/lag_test.h,
  multi_mcw_test.h, multi_mmc_test.h, lz78y_test.h and the functions predictionEstimate,
  calc_p_local and prediction_estimate_function and the class PostfixDictionary of
  cpp/shared/utils.h. The translation keeps the order of operations and the tie rules of the
